Note on third-party assets
--------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the source code of this project.

Planetary textures under `public/textures/` are **not** covered by it. They come
from Solar System Scope (CC BY 4.0) and the three.js repository (MIT; base
imagery from NASA public-domain data). See `public/textures/CREDITS.md` for the
full list and the attribution requirements that apply if you redistribute them.
